    <briefdescription>
<para>This class is an extension of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_buffer" kindref="compound">MemoryBuffer</ref>, which allows copy-on-write access to the underlying contents. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It only supports creation methods that are guaranteed to produce a writable buffer. For example, mapping a file read-only is not supported. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
